          "Service Correlation: See how tip percentages fluctuate based on time of day or party size."
        ]
      },
      {
        "heading": "4. Target Market",
        "content": "Our primary market includes urban Millennials and Gen Z diners who value transparency and social proof. Secondary markets include international travelers and business professionals who need to justify expenses and adhere to corporate tipping norms."
