        "heading": "5. Business Model",
        "points": [
          "Freemium Model: Free access to basic averages; premium 'Pro' features for detailed analytics and travel guides.",
          "B2B Data Insights: Selling anonymized, aggregated sentiment and tipping data to restaurant groups to help them benchmark their service performance against competitors.",
