        ]
      },
      {
        "heading": "6. Competitive Advantage",
        "content": "Unlike general review sites like Yelp or TripAdvisor, Tipperary focuses exclusively on the financial transaction. Our niche focus allows for a cleaner UI and a more specialized dataset that restaurants and diners can't find anywhere else. We turn a subjective social interaction into a verifiable data point."
      },
      {
        "heading": "7. The Vision",
        "content": "Our goal is to become the global standard for gratuity transparency. We want to empower diners to feel confident in their spending and help excellent service staff get the recognition—and the percentages—they deserve based on community-validated standards."
      }
    ]
  }
